{"reviewId": "8508686_7ZgX0AAKv", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "衰退期是增长放缓，因此衰退期结束才是顶；回升期是下降放缓，因此回升期结束才是底。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2120", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "8508686_7ZgX0AAKv", "userVid": 8508686, "topics": [], "createTime": 1744162094, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 8508686, "name": "xdsjs", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDdDlibfxQicTrwZRd8uaUd0FJMvm2cgYYwia4XZRjSiaouj1GvjmicnSq3G73fIMUYia1vSo/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "思考本质", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 342, "likes": [{"userVid": 25326002, "name": "阿兵", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/LlqrXrkXjicHgX3emGCnRib8wtpNzeJnc8WNpZx38Z1nw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 7, "hotComments": [{"content": "衰退   /\\   萧条\n繁荣   | |   回升\n所以用图像来讲应该是这样的。", "reviewId": "8508686_7ZgX0AAKv", "commentId": "8508686_7ZgX0AAKv_c76452918_83NETHfLq", "userVid": 76452918, "createTime": 1760106368, "likesCount": 6, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 76452918, "name": "李煊赫", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/ZPvd2mjNrB2F0AiciavnWV8Vyjm6xtXd4c9icOaDLtON7suUNic